@startuml
title RF55 — Snaps-alvo, rodízio da linha e química · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "MoraleEngine" as MoraleEngine
control "MatchSimulator" as MatchSimulator
control "ClubAnalyst" as ClubAnalyst
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
actor "Jogador (IA)" as JogadorIA
Manager -> Frontend: abre Snaps e química
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/snap-plan
API -> UseCase: GetSnapPlanUseCase
UseCase -> MySQL: plano, depth chart, snaps da temporada
UseCase -> ClubAnalyst: química OL e QB-WR
ClubAnalyst --> UseCase: níveis
UseCase --> API: SnapPlanView
API --> Frontend: 200
Manager -> Frontend: ajusta alvos
Frontend -> API: PUT /careers/{id}/snap-plan
API -> UseCase: UpdateSnapPlanUseCase
alt incoerente / rodízio inválido / jogador inativo
  API --> Frontend: 422
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: UPDATE snap_plan version+1
  alt partida LIVE
    UseCase -> Redis: pendente para o intervalo
  end
  API --> Frontend: 200 + avisos de fadiga
end
note over UseCase: no jogo, MatchSimulator lê o plano e grava snaps em PlayerMatchStats
MatchSimulator -> MoraleEngine: snaps × expectativa
MoraleEngine -> JogadorIA: moral atualizada
@enduml
